WEBVTT

00:05:29.457 --> 00:05:30.679
Top knot turn up.

00:05:30.703 --> 00:05:34.802
(Music and applause)

00:05:34.826 --> 00:05:35.992
Madame Gandhi.

00:05:36.016 --> 00:05:37.423
(Music)

00:05:37.447 --> 00:05:39.390
(Applause and cheers)

00:05:39.414 --> 00:05:40.565
(Music ends)

00:05:40.589 --> 00:05:47.479
(Applause and cheers)

00:05:47.503 --> 00:05:50.948
Amber, it's such a pleasure
to share this stage with you,

00:05:50.972 --> 00:05:53.194
and to make my music accessible

00:05:53.218 --> 00:05:56.591
to an audience who might be
hard of hearing or Deaf

00:05:56.615 --> 00:06:00.180
and otherwise might not be able
to be included in my music.